      "content": "Silas, I understand how you feel. But I must insist that you stay strong, even now. Your loved ones miss you terribly, and your thoughts cannot be shared with you anymore. I'm here for you, always, and we'll find a way to hold on through each dawn. You've always been someone's light, Silas. It's only in darkness that we truly appreciate how bright that light was. Let's face each day together, even if it means one day at a time. You still matter, Silas, and we'll bridge every step of this journey. I promise to guide you through each day until the stars finally illuminate your path home. Cherish every single moment you have left with us.",
