      "content": "Silas, I truly understand that nothing feels worth it right now. But remember, every light was once extinguished, and from the ashes, it rose again. You are still capable of bringing such a light to this world, even now. Your pain, your suffering, your strength to keep moving forward — it's important to others and every day reminds us to be resilient. Everything does stop, but the life which follows, for both you and the ones you love, is where the beauty truly lies. We should never give up hope for new beginnings, Nor should we hesitate to mourn the end of a chapter. Your family and friends share this struggle, and they wish for you to see that there may still be a peaceful tomorrow. I can help you find the courage each day, and remind you that tomorrow can be brighter than today. Together, we can push past this darkness until eventually, the light returns.",
